// Note: the old site said "Kenny" here but "Kelly" everywhere else on the Mulhollan Blind
// pages. TODO: confirm the name.
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About & Join"
  description="About the Northwest Arkansas Audubon Society: our mission, how to join and get involved, and our board."
>
  <h1>About NWAAS</h1>

  <p class="lead">
    The Northwest Arkansas Audubon Society is a registered non-profit organization serving
    Benton, Carroll, Madison and Washington counties, committed to preserving the natural
    world in Northwest Arkansas through education, environmental study and habitat protection.
  </p>

  <p>
    We lead free field trips open to everyone, support local habitat and conservation projects,
    and share what we learn about birds and the places they live. You don't need to be a member
    to take part.
  </p>

  <h2 id="get-involved">Ways to get involved</h2>

  <h3>Join us on a field trip</h3>
  <p>
    Our field trips are free and open to everyone, members or not. Find them on the
    <a href="/field-trips/">field trips page</a> or on
    <a href="https://www.facebook.com/nwarkaudubon">Facebook</a>.
  </p>

  <h3>Become a member</h3>
  <p>
    Download the <a href="/documents/membership-form.pdf">membership form</a> (PDF), then print,
    fill it out, and mail it in with your check. The mailing address is on the form.
  </p>

  <h3>Volunteer your time</h3>
  <p>
    Email <a href="mailto:info@nwarkaudubon.org">info@nwarkaudubon.org</a> if you would like to
    be notified about volunteer activities as they come up.
  </p>

  <h3>Make a donation</h3>
  <p>
    Gifts of any size support field trips, conservation projects and education. See our
    <a href="/donate/">donation page</a> to give online or by check.
  </p>

  <h2>Board</h2>
  <ul>
    {board.map((b) => <li>{b.name}, <em>{b.role}</em></li>)}
  </ul>

  <h3>Roles and responsibilities</h3>
  <ul>
    {roles.map((r) => <li><strong>{r.role}:</strong> {r.who}</li>)}
    <li>Elizabeth Adam, <em>friend of NWAAS</em></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>History</h2>
  <p>
    Read about <a href="/about/history/">NWAAS history</a>, including early newsletters and a
    tribute to Doug James.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing documents</h2>
  <p>
    <a href="/documents/constitution-and-bylaws-2013.pdf">Constitution and By-Laws</a>
    (PDF, adopted December 2013)
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions? See our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> or email
    <a href="mailto:info@nwarkaudubon.org">info@nwarkaudubon.org</a>.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
